      "value": "I made my own redesign concept and suggestions as well, https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1878-the-new-social-menu-ui-feedback-and-suggestions\n\nThough I didn't end up designing a concept based on other player profiles, mine was an edit of your own local profile. One thing yours is missing though is an area for the note.\n\nHere's the image of the redesign as well. My post goes over why I made each change, but like yours most of it boils down to wanting it all in 1 screen.",
