      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been making updated design concepts and individual posts requesting each of them to be reviewed. I made a deliberate point of leaving some of the more specific choices in place so it's not a complete overhaul, and also to leave the bio at full width so it can maintain itself as the more curated and majority section of the profile.\n\nHere are all of the individual posts, each with their own (I think) reasonable reasons to be implemented. If anyone else sees and wants to vote on them.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-badges-shouldnt-be-their-own-bubble-anymore-in-the-profile\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-current-avatar-shouldnt-be-displayed-in-the-local-profile\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-groups-bubble-in-profile-should-show-only-your-represented-group-like-live\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-reimplement-read-more-kind-of\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-local-profile-missing-return-button\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879remove-the-profile-wallet-inventory-from-local-profile",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
